<text font-family="sans-serif" fill="black" x="230" y="230"
      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PC 05.054 Three Arc Pendeloque</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">Steele, Norman W; Facet Design v3 (1980) pC-35</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="266">Angles for R.I. = 1.540</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="284">63 facets + 20 girdles</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="302">1-fold, mirror-image symmetry; 96 index</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="320">L/W = 2.235  T/W = 1.501  U/W = 0.500</tspan>
